## Documentation synchronisation

Documentation is updated in the same commit as the code that invalidates it. A changed rule updates this file{{#HAS_ADR}}, plus an ADR when the decision is structural{{/HAS_ADR}}.

{{#HAS_GENERATED_ARTEFACTS}}
**Exception — generated artefacts**: {{GENERATED_PATHS}} are dated snapshots, exempt from same-commit updating. They derive from the repository and never govern it: on divergence, the code and the hand-written documentation win.
